{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"九龍灣麗晶花園有單位起火　兩人受傷送院\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/FIRE-KLB-261104-06.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】九龍灣麗晶花園有單位起火，兩人受傷送院。</p><p>一名女子須戴上氧氣罩用擔架床送院，有居民帶同寵物到安全位置。</p><p>凌晨3時許，麗晶花園22座5樓一個單位突然冒煙起火，消防到場開喉將火撲熄，約150名居民自行疏散，期間一男一女居民受傷送院治理。</p><p>消防經初步調查，相信是插蘇過熱引致火警。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T00:00:31.726213+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":145,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T23:27:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T09:18:27.129273+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T23:58:33.764230+00:00","content_hash":"4a254c824f082ff343f240b7c932c0795db777149c46b5e20538b3b11e0fe80f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-04T00:00:31.726213+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}